Third-party content

stock/benchmarks/  Job shop benchmark instances (Fisher and Thompson 1963, Lawrence 1984,
  Adams, Balas and Zawack 1988, Applegate and Cook 1991, Storer, Wu and Vaccari 1992,
  Yamada and Nakano 1992, Taillard 1993, Demirkol, Mehta and Uzsoy 1998) with lower bounds
  and best known solutions, converted from Thomas Weise, jsspInstancesAndResults (2020),
  https://github.com/thomasWeise/jsspInstancesAndResults (GPL-3.0, see
  stock/benchmarks/LICENSE-GPL-3.0.txt).

Fonts (Instrument Sans, JetBrains Mono) are loaded from Google Fonts (SIL Open Font License).

Best known solutions of the Taillard instances are not distributed with this software: the app downloads them on
request from optimizizer.com (maintained by Oleg Shylo, https://optimizizer.com/TA.php), checks them by replaying
them on the Petri net, stores them in the data folder and cites the page with every replay.
